# Type errors are advisory — eval proceeds despite type mismatch
# A function with annotated Int param is called with a string.
# The type checker will emit a type mismatch error, but evaluation
# should still succeed and return the string value.
[f: [fn [x@Int] $x]
 result: [call $f "hello"]]
===
Dict({"f": Function(x), "result": String("hello")})
